<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-subobscura-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila subobscura Turing wavelength at 3.0 µm (Pass 2) — Morphological realism / specimen match: 82/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The comparison figure places the Cooper collage beside the spot field and beside the masked pigment composite. The GIF's last frame is that composite, so the silhouette matches the photograph by construction of the mask. The reaction-diffusion panel is a spot lattice at the pinned wavelength, not a redrawing of the wing veins. Score reflects that distinction." ;
